{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06069","headline":"奉和圣制十五夜然灯继以酺宴应制 · 王维","name":"奉和圣制十五夜然灯继以酺宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上路笙歌满，春城漏刻长。\n游人多昼日，明月让灯光。\n鱼钥通翔凤，龙舆出建章。\n九衢陈广乐，百福透名香。\n仙伎来金殿，都人遶玉堂。\n定应偷妙舞，从此学新妆。\n奉引迎三事，司仪列万方。\n愿将天地寿，同以献君王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06069.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06069","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}